===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₃reǵ-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|reguler}}, from {{der|en|xno|reguler}}, {{der|en|frm|reguler}}, {{m|frm|regulier}}, and their source, {{der|en|la|rēgulāris|t=continuing rules for guidance}}, from {{m|la|rēgula|t=rule}}, ultimately from {{der|en|ine-pro|*reg-|t=move in a straight line}}.

