#: {{syn|en|weak|q=verbs}}
#: {{ant|en|irregular|strong|q2=verbs}}
#: {{ux|en|"Walked" is the past tense of the '''regular''' verb "to walk".}}
# {{senseid|en|ordinary, normal, common, standard}} {{lb|en|chiefly|US}} Having the expected characteristics or appearances; [[normal]], [[ordinary]], [[standard]]. {{defdate|from 17th c.}}
